  "bio": "Yula Ma is a highly skilled tattoo artist based in Venice, LA, specializing in tribal and geometric designs. A ceremonial handpoke tattoo artist, Yula brings precision and artistry to every piece, reflecting their profound tagline 'the future has an ancient heart.' Clients can expect a blend of traditional techniques with contemporary aesthetics, ensuring a unique tattoo experience. To book a session with Yula, one can reach out via yulama369@gmail.com."
